item.p:
clinical trials of medical devices under Article 1 MedDO and Article 1 of the Ordinance of 4 May 2022
SR 812.219 on In Vitro Diagnostic Medical Devices: for such trials, the Ordinance of 1 July 2020
SR 810.306 on Clinical Trials of Medical Devices (ClinO-MD) applies;

the devices under Article 1 MedDO

  SR 812.213
	 bear conformity markings as specified in Article 13 MedDO and are used in accordance with the instructions for use;

content.p:
When a prenatal risk assessment is conducted (Art. 3 let. h HGTA

  SR 810.12
	) the pregnant woman must additionally be informed about the matters specified in Article 23 HGTA.

